Date: Thu, 22 Oct 2026 22:42:38 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] fix(file-safety): read+write-deny
 ~/.config/token-broker (broker client token) [daveey]

The enrolled token-broker client token lets its holder exec auto-tier scopes
(e.g. tailnet SSH key) with no approval. Add .config/token-broker to
HOME_CREDENTIAL_DIRS (write deny, profile export, @file refs) and a new
HOME_READ_DENIED_DIRS so read_file / search / vision / raise_if_read_blocked
refuse it (token + token.expired-*), across every guard home.
